{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他没能藏好自己对一个人的喜欢，心里空落落的。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"空落、忐忑、松一口气\",\n      \"missed\": \"贴近耳语后交谈突然中断的具体场景，以及“这份幸福真实吗”的疑问；右侧前两条淡色文字也不容易一眼抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他没能藏好自己的喜欢，心里空落落的。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"空落、忐忑、松一口气\",\n      \"missed\": \"两个人刚才亲密耳语、随后交谈戛然而止的情境，以及对幸福真实性的怀疑，需要读完长句才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他没能藏好自己的喜欢，心里空落落的。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"空落、忐忑、松一口气\",\n      \"missed\": \"亲密交谈突然结束的具体情境和“这份幸福真实吗”的内心疑问；右侧三条状态之间的关系也需要进一步阅读才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主标题能快速传达喜欢没藏住和心里空落，但具体发生了什么、为什么会空落，主要藏在一条较长的副文里。右侧高亮的“心意露出来又怕被嫌”与标题有呼应，却和具体场景相隔较远。一眼扫过能抓到情绪和大致处境，但还不容易把心意暴露、亲密交谈中断、怀疑幸福这几层自然串成一个完整瞬间。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ca7b9744-ba60-4757-9b1c-ea034a2f2b6d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T005429288801Z", "elapsed_seconds": 73.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:55:43.163269+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "efd68e6f0229c58583a11e08929a38fa80156102fe16c430ea4e279e3fdea85c", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests